      'Automatically found shapes (span up to 4 frets, max. 4 fingers, a barre counts as one). Bass matches the selected inversion. Click a shape to show it on the fretboard and hear it. “Shape C/A/G/E/D” (the CAGED system) tells you which open chord the shape comes from when moved along the neck — five shapes cover the whole fretboard.',
